# Go tooling (gofmt, golangci-lint) requires LF. Without this, a Windows
# checkout converts every file to CRLF and `gofmt -l .` reports the entire
# tree as unformatted — which is exactly how CI failed on windows-latest.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.epub binary
*.msg binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
testdata/fuzz/** -text
